### Emotion sample
POST http://localhost:3000/api/emotion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "demo-user",
  "timestamp": 1730582000,
  "dominant": "fear",
  "scores": {
    "happy": 0.05,
    "sad": 0.12,
    "fear": 0.64,
    "angry": 0.04,
    "neutral": 0.15
  }
}

### Chat sample - new session
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "demo-user",
  "message": "Hey Unbind, I'm kind of nervous about meeting new classmates."
}

### Chat sample - follow up with emotion
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "demo-user",
  "message": "That's enough for today, I'm getting tired."
}
